{"error":{"data":{"error":{"code":"invalid_api_key","message":"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.","param":null,"type":"invalid_request_error"}},"isRetryable":false,"name":"AI_APICallError","requestBodyValues":{"input":[{"content":[{"text":"Analyze the sentiment and emotional tone of these news articles.\n\nArticles:\n[0] Title: Boris Johnson cycle superhighway plans cut and delayed | Dave Hill\nDescription: While his allies rally round his flagship project, other elements of the London mayor’s “cycling vision” are being quietly dropped or slowed down<br>\n\n[1] Title: London expands protected cycle lane scheme\nDescription: Mayor Boris Johnson unveils major expansion of bike-only lanes amid growing calls for safer lanes after super-highway deaths\n\n[2] Title: Five cyclists dead in two weeks: is there a way to make London's roads safer?\nDescription: <p>In London more people are travelling by bike, but already this year 13 cyclists have died</p>\n\n[3] Title: Boris Johnson adviser says deaths should not put people off cycling\nDescription: <p>Andrew Gilligan says travelling by bike in London is getting safer and mayor remains committed to improving infrastructure</p>\n\n[4] Title: Is Boris Johnson pushing too fast for a cycle-friendly London?\nDescription: <p>Pressure grows on capital's mayor to rethink cycle superhighways after three deaths in little more than a week</p>\n\nFor each article, determine:\n1. Sentiment: positive, negative, or neutral\n2. Confidence score (0-1)\n3. Emotional tones present (e.g., optimism, concern, excitement, anger, hope, fear)","type":"input_text"}],"role":"user"}],"model":"gpt-4o-mini","temperature":0.2,"text":{"format":{"name":"response","schema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"sentiments":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"emotions":{"description":"Detected emotions (e.g., optimism, concern, anger)","items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"index":{"description":"Article index","type":"number"},"score":{"description":"Confidence score 0-1","maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"sentiment":{"description":"Overall sentiment","enum":["positive","negative","neutral"],"type":"string"}},"required":["index","sentiment","score","emotions"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"}},"required":["sentiments"],"type":"object"},"strict":false,"type":"json_schema"}}},"responseBody":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"message\": \"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.\",\n    \"type\": \"invalid_request_error\",\n    \"param\": null,\n    \"code\": \"invalid_api_key\"\n  }\n}","responseHeaders":{"alt-svc":"h3=\":443\"; ma=86400","cf-cache-status":"DYNAMIC","cf-ray":"9a5dc1ef8bff1da7-LAX","connection":"keep-alive","content-length":"393","content-type":"application/json","date":"Fri, 28 Nov 2025 23:48:41 GMT","openai-processing-ms":"19","openai-version":"2020-10-01","server":"cloudflare","set-cookie":"_cfuvid=vmAVi8bnyvNzBmkFIgaG80fSUwM0so0YgEeAaR2KffM-1764373721607-0.0.1.1-604800000; path=/; domain=.api.openai.com; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=None","strict-transport-security":"max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload","www-authenticate":"Bearer realm=\"OpenAI API\"","x-content-type-options":"nosniff","x-envoy-upstream-service-time":"22","x-request-id":"req_630cc9506667466bb966bb7b92fa676a"},"statusCode":401,"url":"https://api.openai.com/v1/responses"},"level":"error","message":"[sentiment] Failed to analyze sentiment batch","service":"llm-dev-project","timestamp":"2025-11-28T23:4