{"error":{"data":{"error":{"code":"invalid_api_key","message":"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.","param":null,"type":"invalid_request_error"}},"isRetryable":false,"name":"AI_APICallError","requestBodyValues":{"input":[{"content":[{"text":"You are a news intelligence assistant. Create a comprehensive, well-structured markdown report based on the analysis below.\n\nUser Query: \"CS2\"\n\nAnalysis Data:\n=== NEWS ARTICLES ===\n[1] Sparkle Intel Arc B570 Guardian OC 10GB Graphics Card $329 Delivered ($0 VIC C&C) @ PC Case Gear (Ozbargain.com.au)\nThere are 2 other variants that are near if not absolutely identical other than the colour of the plastic. https://www.pccasegear.com/products/70903 https://www.pccasegear.com/products/68018 Boost …\nURL: https://www.ozbargain.com.au/node/936671\n[2] This fishing game awards bonus XP for no-scoping an airborne mackerel, and I think that's beautiful (PC Gamer)\nFishing involves more sniper rifles and bare-knuckle fisticuffs than I remember.\nURL: https://www.pcgamer.com/games/sim/this-fishing-game-awards-bonus-xp-for-no-scoping-an-airborne-mackerel-and-i-think-thats-beautiful/\n[3] A few hundred employees working on \"self-directed projects\" has made Valve one of the world's most profitable-per-person companies, on track to top $17 billion this year and shame the likes of Google and Meta (GamesRadar+)\nYou get a yacht, and you get a yacht\nURL: https://www.gamesradar.com/games/a-few-hundred-employees-working-on-self-directed-projects-has-made-valve-one-of-the-worlds-most-profitable-per-person-companies-on-track-to-top-usd17-billion-this-year-and-shame-the-likes-of-google-and-meta/\n[4] Prime Members: BOSGAME M4 Plus Mini PC (R9 7940HS, 32GB DDR5, 1TB SSD) $442.49 + Free Shipping (Slickdeals.net)\nBOSGAME Store via Amazon [amazon.com] has for *Prime Members: BOSGAME M4 Plus Mini PC *on sale for &589.99 - *25% off* when you visit the promo code page to activate [amazon.com] (or apply code...\nURL: https://slickdeals.net/f/18862639-prime-members-bosgame-m4-plus-mini-pc-r9-7940hs-32gb-ddr5-1tb-ssd-442-49-free-shipping\n[5] Estimates peg Valve as a capitalism fusion reactor, making such ungodly money per employee that it's no wonder Gabe Newell bought all those yachts and the whole damn yacht company (PC Gamer)\nBut bear in mind estimates are all we have to go off until an accountant leaves Valve's books in a bar.\nURL: https://www.pcgamer.com/gaming-industry/estimates-peg-valve-as-a-capitalism-fusion-reactor-making-such-ungodly-money-per-employee-that-its-no-wonder-gabe-newell-bought-all-those-yachts-and-the-whole-damn-yacht-company/\n[6] RNG2 tethers the conoid to the apical polar ring in Toxoplasma gondii to enable parasite motility and invasion (Plos.org)\nThe conoid is a structure in Apicomplexans that undergoes extrusion during egress, gliding motility, and invasion. This study shows that the coiled-coil protein RNG2 tethers the conoid to the apical polar ring in Toxoplasma gondii; its disruption causes conoi…\nURL: https://journals.plos.org/plosbiology/article?id=10.1371/journal.pbio.3003506\n[7] Valve makes almost $50 million per employee, raking in more cash per person than Google, Amazon, or Microsoft — gaming giant's 350 employees on track to generate $17 billion this year (Tom's Hardware UK)\nValve's unique approach to corporate governance is probably the reason why it's such an efficient company.\nURL: https://www.tomshardware.com/video-games/pc-gaming/valve-makes-almost-usd50-million-per-employee-raking-in-more-cash-per-person-than-google-amazon-or-microsoft-gaming-giants-350-employees-on-track-to-generate-usd17-billion-this-year\n[8] SSD slowdown after some time (BleepingComputer)\nSSD slowdown after some time - posted in Internal Hardware: So, I 