elix.net/notes/the-cities-skyline-paradox\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=45978541\nPoints: 4\n# Comments: 1\nURL: https://selix.net/notes/the-cities-skyline-paradox\n[14] Keychron Q HE 8K Ceramic Keyboard Review : 8,000 Hz Polling Rate, Magnetic Switches & More (Geeky Gadgets)\nWhat happens when a keyboard is treated not as an accessory, but as an expression of engineering ambition? Most keyboards follow predictable formulas: aluminum cases, plastic keycaps, familiar switches. Keychron’s new Q16 HE 8K Ceramic Keyboard breaks entirel…\nURL: https://www.geeky-gadgets.com/keychron-q16-he-8k-ceramic-keyboard-review/\n[15] Counter-Strike 2 modders surprise drop an excellent Halo 3 multiplayer pack, accidentally proving how badly Valve has squandered Source 2 (PC Gamer)\nFOV 90: Project Misriah is a glimpse at the offbeat Source 2 shooters we should have by now, if not for Valve.\nURL: https://www.pcgamer.com/games/fps/counter-strike-2-modders-surprise-drop-an-excellent-halo-3-multiplayer-pack-accidentally-proving-how-badly-valve-has-squandered-source-2/\n[16] Mesa 25.3.0 released with lots of Linux graphics driver improvements (Gamingonlinux.com)\nJust as the weekend arrived, Mesa 25.3.0 was released as the latest new-feature upgrade for open source Linux graphics drivers..Read the full article on GamingOnLinux.\nURL: https://www.gamingonlinux.com/2025/11/mesa-25-3-0-released-with-lots-of-linux-graphics-driver-improvements/.\n[17] Razer Unveils New Counter-Strike 2 Gaming Gear Collection (Bleeding Cool News)\nRazer and Valve have come together for a new collaboration, as the company revealed several new items as part of their Counter-Strike 2 Collection. As it is with many of these types of packages, these are items that are already in the lineup of gaming gear th…\nURL: https://bleedingcool.com/games/razer-unveils-new-counter-strike-2-gaming-gear-collection/\n[18] Stimulus-to-stimulus learning in RNNs with cortical inductive biases (Plos.org)\nAutho