{"error":{"data":{"error":{"code":"invalid_api_key","message":"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.","param":null,"type":"invalid_request_error"}},"isRetryable":false,"name":"AI_APICallError","requestBodyValues":{"input":[{"content":[{"text":"Analyze the sentiment and emotional tone of these news articles.\n\nArticles:\n[0] Title: Meet the AI vegans | Arwa Mahdawi\nDescription: They are choosing to abstain from using artificial intelligence for environmental, ethical and personal reasons. Maybe they have a point, writes Guardian columnist Arwa Mahdawi\n\n[1] Title: The mind-boggling valuations of AI companies \nDescription: You try wrapping your head around a string of deals worth nearly $600bn\n\n[2] Title: ‘We excel at every phase of AI’: Nvidia CEO quells Wall Street fears of AI bubble amid market selloff\nDescription: Jensen Huang opens earnings call with attempt to dispel concerns after his $5tn firm beat Wall Street expectations\n\n[3] Title: Why university lecturers are turning to AI in classes | Letters\nDescription: Letter: <strong>Dr Talia Hussain </strong>says there is no incentive for lecturers to invest hours preparing a module they may teach only once\n\n[4] Title: It’s time to prepare for AI personhood | Jacy Reese Anthis\nDescription: Technological advances will bring social upheaval. How will we treat digital minds, and how will they treat us?\n\nFor each article, determine:\n1. Sentiment: positive, negative, or neutral\n2. Confidence score (0-1)\n3. Emotional tones present (e.g., optimism, concern, excitement, anger, hope, fear)","type":"input_text"}],"role":"user"}],"model":"gpt-4o-mini","temperature":0.2,"text":{"format":{"name":"response","schema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalPropert