{"error":{"data":{"error":{"code":"invalid_api_key","message":"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.","param":null,"type":"invalid_request_error"}},"isRetryable":false,"name":"AI_APICallError","requestBodyValues":{"input":[{"content":[{"text":"Analyze the sentiment and emotional tone of these news articles.\n\nArticles:\n[0] Title: Former Greek PM Tsipras savages ‘celebrity’ ex-finance minister Varoufakis in memoir \nDescription: Alexis Tsipras says that during debt crisis Yanis Varoufakis was more interested in promoting his books\n\n[1] Title: What exactly is climate finance? Who pays it? And who gets it? \nDescription: Richer countries have agreed to give poorer nations hundreds of billions to cut emissions, but details can be hard to find\n\n[2] Title: Santander urges ministers to intervene in UK car finance compensation scheme\nDescription: Lender’s chief executive says redress proposals could affect jobs, supply chains and broader UK economy\n\n[3] Title: Chelsea have £150m buffer against fines from FA, say football finance experts\nDescription: Revelation may make points deduction or suspension from competition over Abramovich-era breaches more likely\n\n[4] Title: City watchdog ‘nakedly’ siding with lenders on car finance redress, MPs say \nDescription: Cross-party group says Financial Conduct Authority had been ‘patently influenced’ by concerns over profits\n\nFor each article, determine:\n1. Sentiment: positive, negative, or neutral\n2. Confidence score (0-1)\n3. Emotional tones present (e.g., optimism, concern, excitement, anger, hope, fear)","type":"input_text"}],"role":"user"}],"model":"gpt-4o-mini","temperature":0.2,"text":{"format":{"name":"response","schema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"sentiments":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"emotions":{"description":"Detected emotions (e.g., optimism, concern, anger)","items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"index":{"description":"Article index","type":"number"},"score":{"description":"Confidence score 0-1","maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"sentiment":{"description":"Overall sentiment","enum":["positive","negative","neutral"],"type":"string"}},"required":["index","sentiment","score","emotions"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"}},"required":["sentiments"],"type":"object"},"strict":false,"type":"json_schema"}}},"responseBody":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"message\": \"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.\",\n    \"type\": \"invalid_request_error\",\n    \"param\": null,\n    \"code\": \"invalid_api_key\"\n  }\n}","responseHeaders":{"alt-svc":"h3=\":443\"; ma=86400","cf-cache-status":"DYNAMIC","cf-ray":"9a5ddf4bbe50f210-LAX","connection":"keep-alive","content-length":"393","content-type":"application/json","date":"Sat, 29 Nov 2025 00:08:44 GMT","openai-processing-ms":"18","openai-version":"2020-10-01","server":"cloudflare","set-cookie":"_cfuvid=gNPeC6X3jNyii63pmtWcUTIMs4DPdFAPzc6RtmJmp_0-1764374924187-0.0.1.1-604800000; path=/; domain=.api.openai.com; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=None","strict-transport-security":"max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload","www-authenticate":"Bearer realm=\"OpenAI API\"","x-content-type-options":"nosniff","x-envoy-upstream-service-time":"20","x-request-id":"req_cd11d5ad837c4a75a93d15e8908150e2"},"statusCode":401,"url":"https://api.openai.com/v1/responses"},"level":"error","message":"[sentiment] Failed to analyze sentiment batch","service":"llm-dev-project","timestamp":"2025-11-29T00:08:44.233Z"