ame, 28/11/25: Celtic's Lisbon Lions (FourFourTwo)\nWelcome to FourFourTwo's Dating Game, which today features Celtic\nURL: https://www.fourfourtwo.com/quiz/fourfourtwo-dating-game-28-11-25\n[5] AEW Collision Preview: The Perfect Thanksgiving Dessert (Bleeding Cool News)\nGreetings, comrades! It is I, your El Presidente, reporting to you live on tonight's AEW Collision from my presidential palace's banquet hall, where I am currently hiding from my own chef who insists on preparing a traditional American Thanksgiving turkey des…\nURL: https://bleedingcool.com/tv/aew-collision-preview-the-perfect-thanksgiving-dessert/\n[6] More Than Half of Hedge Funds Now Hold Crypto as Industry Sees 'Turning Point' (Yahoo Entertainment)\nThe institutional embrace of cryptocurrency just crossed a major threshold—and the numbers reveal how quickly Wall Street’s skepticism is evaporating in...\nURL: https://finance.yahoo.com/news/more-half-hedge-funds-now-233006607.html\n[7] From shampoo scientist to turtle saver: WWF’s Maggie Ka Ka Lee is turning science into action for the planet (CNA)\nOnce a formulator for global beauty brands, Maggie Ka Ka Lee now leads World Wide Fund for Nature’s impact work across the Asia-Pacific. Here’s how she’s making science, strategy and storytelling work for a wilder, greener world.\nURL: https://cnalifestyle.channelnewsasia.com/women/maggie-ka-ka-lee-wwf-environment-conservation-474126\n[8] Singapore firms plan to dial back on raises, bonuses amid economic uncertainty: Survey (The Straits Times)\nOver one-fifth of companies intend to give out salary increments of less than 3 per cent. Read more at straitstimes.com. Read more at straitstimes.com.\nURL: https://www.straitstimes.com/business/companies-markets/singapore-firms-plan-to-dial-back-on-raises-bonuses-amid-economic-uncertainty-survey\n[9] Oil Markets Lackluster Amid Russia Peace Deal, China’s Stockpiling (OilPrice.com)\nSentiment in oil markets remains overwhelmingly negative, driven by perceived 