{"error":{"data":{"error":{"code":"invalid_api_key","message":"Incorrect API key provided: Sk-proj-********************************************************************************************************************************************************-SsA. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.","param":null,"type":"invalid_request_error"}},"isRetryable":false,"name":"AI_APICallError","requestBodyValues":{"input":[{"content":[{"text":"You are a news intelligence assistant. Create a comprehensive, well-structured markdown report based on the analysis below.\n\nUser Query: \"Skiing\"\n\nAnalysis Data:\n=== NEWS ARTICLES ===\n[1] Carv 2 Ski Coach A$227 for a year (with 20% for BF and A$76 discount with referral) (Ozbargain.com.au)\nCarv are offering 20% off normal price of an annual pass (sensors included) for Black Friday. Use referral link or coupon for an extra $76 discount brining it down to A$227 for a year. Referrer gets …\nURL: https://www.ozbargain.com.au/node/936965\n[2] With eyes on Olympics, Anchorage's Schumacher leads Americans into pivotal ski season (Anchorage Daily News)\nNov. 27—Historically, Gus Schumacher has been at his best in February. In February 2024, the Anchorage cross country skier became the first American to win a World Cup distance race in four decades. As Schumacher embarks on the 2025-26 World Cup season, the 2…\nURL: https://www.adn.com/sports/skiing/2025/11/27/with-eyes-on-olympics-anchorages-schumacher-leads-americans-into-pivotal-ski-season/\n[3] Active holidays in South Korea: Where to hike, ski and paraglide (New Zealand Herald)\nNearly 70% of South Korea is mountainous, offering an abundance of activites.\nURL: https://www.nzherald.co.nz/travel/active-holidays-in-south-korea-where-to-hike-ski-and-paraglide/FKXDJYVWFNGJDMGV7GSNNWNL5Q/\n[4] Marco Odermatt wins season-opening super-G in Colorado, denying Austria podium sweep (CBC News)\nSwiss ski star Marco Odermatt started the World Cup super-G season with a Thanksgiving win at Copper Mountain on Thursday, while Aleksander Aamodt Kilde reduced fiancée Mikaela Shiffrin to tears by making his comeback after nearly two years out.\nURL: https://www.cbc.ca/sports/olympics/winter/alpine-skiing/odermatt-super-g-copper-mountain-aamodt-kilde-shiffrin-9.6995266\n[5] Odermatt wins season-opening super-G at Copper Mountain as Kilde’s return reduces Shiffrin to tears (The Denver Post)\nSwiss ski star Marco Odermatt started the World Cup super-G season with a Thanksgiving win at Copper Mountain on Thursday, while Aleksander Aamodt Kilde reduced fiancée Mikaela Shiffrin to tears by making his comeback after nearly two years out. Odermatt has …\nURL: https://www.denverpost.com/2025/11/27/marco-odermatt-copper-mountain-aleksander-aamodt-kilde/\n[6] Alpine skiing-Switzerland's Odermatt triumphs in Copper Mountain Super-G (CNA)\nCOPPER MOUNTAIN, United States :Switzerland’s four-times overall champion Marco Odermatt opened his Alpine Ski World Cup Super-G campaign with an emphatic win at Copper Mountain on Thursday as he resumed his pursuit of a fourth straight crystal globe in the d…\nURL: https://www.channelnewsasia.com/sport/alpine-skiing-switzerlands-odermatt-triumphs-in-copper-mountain-super-g-5494671\n[7] 45% off Battery Heated Merino Wool Socks $109 Delivered @Zarkie - Coupon Code Warmfeet - Only 50 Available (Ozbargain.com.au)\nHi everyone, hope you are all well. We’ve been selling these in our shop in Melbourne for over 10 years and we’re putting them on a special (50 pairs only) for people still gift shopping for a …\nURL: https://www.ozbargain.com.au/node/936891\n[8] Fly the Flag: Air Canada Unveils Celebratory Canadian Olympic and Paralympic Team Livery Featuring Canadian Athletes Headed to the Milano Cortina 2026 Winter Games (Financial Post)\nAir Canada will transport more than 750 athletes and delegation members to and from the Games Eight Team Canada members named Team Air Canada Athlete Ambassadors Livery feat